 "notes": [
  "Format Premiere - Tatooine: posted 20 June 2001, before Coruscant (the post says it is for tournaments 'until at least Coruscant'), and the list has no Coruscant-set card.",
  "Starting cards as posted under Starting (4): Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points and There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement; with the Objective and its sites they count toward the 60. Three Effects start via Prepared Defenses, none named as the single starting Effect, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "Total 62 as published: the Characters header says (9) but 11 characters are listed (Guri, Arica and U-3PO beyond the nine).",
  "Posted 'Endor', 'Endor Bunker', 'Endor Landing Platform' and 'Mon Calamari' dested the Dark Endor / Death Star II printings; 'Coruscant Docking Bay' dested the Dark Special Edition site Coruscant: Docking Bay (the Coruscant-set printing was not out yet).",
  "Posted 'U-3P0' dested U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Scythe TIE x2' Scythe Squadron TIE; 'Boba Fett In Slave 1' Boba Fett In Slave I; 'Ominous Rumours' Ominous Rumors; 'Twilek Advisor' Twi'lek Advisor.",
  "Posted 'Oppressive Enforcement/There Is No Try', 'Dark ManueversTallon Roll' and 'Ghhhk/Those Rebel's Won't Escape Us' dested the combo cards There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement, Dark Maneuvers & Tallon Roll and Ghhhk & Those Rebels Won't Escape Us.",
  "Secret Plans and Resistance are Effects in 2001 (pre-Reflections III)."
